- Admin: Secure Agents, Integration Runtimes, VNET/VPC Peering, Licenses, Cost FinOps, Monitoring, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
- Architect: Scalability, High Availability (HA), Disaster Recovery (DR), Data Modeling (Star/Snowflake), Latency (Batch vs Real-time).

COMMON RFP THEMES:
1. "Legacy Modernization": Migration from On-Prem (PowerCenter, SSIS, Mainframe) to Cloud (IDMC, ADF, Glue).
