            Provide a detailed 'rationale' string. It MUST explain the math:
            e.g., "Found 20 tables in Excel summary. Applied 60/30/10 split: 12 Simple, 6 Medium, 2 Complex. Added 1 Task flow per 5 mappings (Total 4)."
        `;

        const response = await retryWithBackoff<GenerateContentResponse>(() => ai.models.generateContent({
