                <div>
                    <h3 className="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Awaiting Analysis</h3>
                    <p className="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        To generate architecture blueprints, cost estimates, and technical requirements, the AI needs to process your request context first.
